      "text": {
        "en": "Customers repeatedly praise Fetchy for lightning-fast order dispatch, often delivering raw foods, kibble, and supplies on the same day when placed before cutoff times. Pet owners emphasize how reliable delivery notifications and real-time tracking provide peace of mind during urgent food shortages."
      }
    },
