        "en": "Thoughtful customer service and care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers warmly highlight the personal touches provided by the team, including handwritten thank-you notes, free sample treats, and helpful dietary recommendations. While one long-term shopper voiced frustration over rising costs and tipping prompts, most clients describe the support as exceptionally attentive."
      }
    },
    {
