      "title": {
        "en": "Curated options for sensitive pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers appreciate the specialized inventory featuring raw formulas, high-grade allergy diet foods, and senior canine recipes. Cat and dog guardians frequently mention that their animals love the complimentary toys and surprise treats thoughtfully tucked inside their delivery packages."
      }
    }
